                                                "sense_id": "afe0e051-eec8-35ca-8c48-a0a3ab5b2f8e",
                                                "text": "The former president’s son Donald Jr. swiped at Ms. Griner’s identity when he wrote that the Biden administration “was apparently worried that their DEI score would go down if they freed an American Marine,” using the corporate-world acronym for diversity, equity and inclusion."
                                            },
