                                                "sense_id": "afe0e051-eec8-35ca-8c48-a0a3ab5b2f8e",
                                                "text": "The universities’ publicly stated positions imply that there is only one proper way to interpret the DEI trinity: through the concept of “anti-racism,” which may not mean what you think it means."
                                            },
